{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14907","headline":"春日卧病示赵季黄 · 卢纶","name":"春日卧病示赵季黄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病中饶泪眼常昏，闻说花开亦闭门。\n语少渐知琴思苦，卧多唯觉鸟声喧。\n黄埃满市图书贱，黑雾连山虎豹尊。\n今日支离顾形影，向君凡在几重恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}